@prefix bc:  <https://ontology.example/banking-core#> .
@prefix rdf:  <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#> .

###############################################################################
# FIBO alignment annotations — REBUILT AND VERIFIED (ontology-enrichment).
# Every IRI below was verified to exist as an owl:Class/NamedIndividual in the
# pinned FIBO snapshot (edmcouncil/fibo commit
# 119fa8c091aa4beece7d22aefa6fe138021a4355, fetched 2026-09-09).
# Annotation only — FIBO is never imported. Definitions in this repository are
# self-authored; FIBO is used for term/hierarchy alignment only.
# See docs/fibo-alignment.md (mapping source of truth) and
# docs/reference/ontology-sources.md (licenses). Verified programmatically by
# scripts/verify_fibo_alignment.py (`make check-alignment`).
###############################################################################

# --- FND/ProductsAndServices/ProductsAndServices ----------------------------
bc:Product
    bc:alignedToFibo <https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/FND/ProductsAndServices/ProductsAndServices/Product> .

# --- FBC/ProductsAndServices/ClientsAndAccounts -----------------------------
bc:Account
    bc:alignedToFibo <https://spec.edmcouncil.org/fibo/ontology/FBC/ProductsAndServices/ClientsAndAccounts/Account> .

